@startuml
' UC-1 through UC-6 — Scenario preparation and Adventure start
title UC-1 — Storybook으로 Scenario를 준비하고 Adventure를 시작한다
left to right direction

actor "Solo Player" as Player
actor "AI Game Master" as GM

rectangle "Scenario Model Runtime" {
  usecase "Storybook 선택" as Select
  usecase "Primary Storybook 결정" as Primary
  usecase "Integration Prompt 입력" as Prompt
  usecase "Creativity 선택\n(기본: CONSERVATIVE)" as Creativity
  usecase "Scenario Compilation 실행" as Compile
  usecase "충돌 해석" as Resolve
  usecase "핵심 정보 보완" as Supplement
  usecase "BLOCKED 진단 제공" as Blocked
  usecase "READY Scenario 생성" as Ready
  usecase "Adventure Start" as Start
  usecase "Scenario Model 및 source 구성 lock" as Lock
  usecase "Situation 진행" as Situation
  usecase "Storybook Fact 조회" as Lookup
  usecase "Runtime-added Fact 생성" as RuntimeFact
  usecase "GM Turn 해결" as Turn
  usecase "Adventure 완료" as Complete
}

Player --> Select
Player --> Primary
Player --> Prompt
Player --> Creativity
Player --> Compile
Player --> Start
GM --> Compile
GM --> Situation
GM --> Lookup
GM --> RuntimeFact
GM --> Turn
GM --> Complete

Compile .> Resolve : <<include>>
Compile .> Supplement : <<extend>>\n핵심 정보가 없을 때
Compile .> Blocked : <<extend>>\n자동 해결 불가
Compile .> Ready : <<include>>
Start .> Ready : <<include>>
Start .> Lock : <<include>>
Situation .> Lookup : <<include>>
Lookup .> RuntimeFact : <<extend>>\nsource 없음
Situation .> Turn : <<include>>
Turn .> Complete : <<extend>>\nresolution condition 충족

note bottom of Resolve
Integration Prompt > Primary > Supplement
충돌 해석에만 적용
end note

note bottom of Supplement
핵심 목표 진행·해결 불가 시에만 허용.
Creativity 자동 승격 없음.
end note
@enduml
